usal and appropriate effective profile. Do not call absent future APIs a delegation. This is consumption of already supplied authority, not new CLI/materialization/publication/storage/transport scope.\n3|Fix the entire relation family before republishing, not just the all-zero digest fixture: real profile.changed positive controls, missing references, wrong type/session/lease where applicable, non-newest/losing source rules, branch/lagging and historical closure controls; old-plan profile-only authority substitution and fresh-plan Revalidate as appropriate through BuildPlan, Revalidate, AuthoritativeStatus/List. Do not use current tail equality or later local events as checkpoint authority. Derive requirements from the pinned rules and record exact semantics/calls/tests in C6 conformance matrix. Earlier brief required this same semantic family; do not repeat the prior claim that summary-only APIs enforce it. Narrowing plants must demonstrate the new production gate and a truly applied harmless SURVIVED control on final source.\n4|Retain closed CR7 missing/later checkpoint heads, old-plan substitutions, persistence variant, ancestry/creator, canonical identity, lagging copies, parked required sources, capabilities, predecessor/reducer/enums/crashes. Avoid redundant unrelated audits. Preserve8-row AC denominator and precise caller CLI boundary, correcting partial/failing claims only with real evidence. Read Curator Go testing skill, all CI local. Run affected tests and required full validation, attach outcome, exact-source evidence and clause matrix, then normal producer handoff. No accepting your own work or landing. Canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board. Muse muse-spark xhigh.","final_result":true}}}
