ther than treating an untested suspicion as a finding. Do not expand scope to caller-owned publication/storage/transport/CLI/effects. Do not narrow the assigned consumer contract to canonical shape or passing fixtures.\n3|Retain closed persistence variant (direct/task_board winner and ancestor), N-chain-self behavioral kill, ancestry/creator, canonical identity, lagging copies, parked source, capabilities and earlier predecessor/reducer/crash findings unless new evidence contradicts them. Inspect affected mutation evidence on exact final source with an applied harmless SURVIVED control; compile failures, unapplied plants and empty selections are not behavioral proof. Preserve the eight-row AC denominator and precise public caller boundary.\n4|Use immutable current CR bytes, isolated probes, Curator Go testing skill and local CI only. Preserve live product/index/branch. Attach exact verdict and reproducible evidence, use live merged checklist and normal accept_cr or changes-requested handoff. No implementation, integration or manual commits by reviewer. Codex gpt-6-astra medium; canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board.","final_result":true}}}
